cially when you're also blessed with  mythically tough punches that can  literally disintegrate a foe into a bag  of bones but like  without the bag shiva might not be a  go-to character for a lot of people  since she isn't quite as tough as some  of the other fighters but  she does have a killer fatality in  mortal kombat 3 the forearmed denizen  of death grabs you with all four of her  upper limbs and  rips your skin right off raiden might  explode you into individual bony bits  but  shiva peels you like a goddamn banana  and leaves you standing there screaming  in pain with all your gory bloody bits  still attached  while your skin suit crumbles into a  heap on the ground  eww earning the top spot is  mortal kombat favorite subzero who's  credited with the fatality colloquially  referred to  as the esrb maker first up a short  history lesson  the mortal kombat series had parents  everywhere enraged by the idea of their  children seeing such  extreme violence and gore in their video  games  and this fatality from sub-zero was the  final straw  the brutality of sub-zero tearing his  opponent's head off in a flurry of blood  with the spine still attached  was enough to spur on the creation of  the entertainment  software rating board it's their job to  decide what content is appropriate for  what age group and they're still rating  all your games today  for that alone we have to give the top  spot to sub-zero  so congratulations you sadistic brutal  son of a [ __ ]  let me know if you think mortal kombat's  fatalities are pretty cool  or too violent which one is your  favorite and what awesome ones did i  miss out on i'll catch you again next  week
 

